# shell-leave -- W5-E2 acceptance (R-143): a shell page leaves with the
# SDBTNANM leave band before the next page enters [RE: gamemd FUN_00606980,
# leave flag off]: live button rows play 5..10 (the face sliding back into its
# socket), rows without a button play the 11..16 plate band, row i starting
# i+1 ticks of 30 ms late; the page switch waits for it. Under --play the
# band only plays after `set leave_band 1` (other scripts switch at once).
set on_quit continue
set leave_band 1
require scene == "shell:Main Menu"
click button "Single Player"
assert shell_leaving == 1                               @R-143
assert scene == "shell:Main Menu"                       @R-143
wait 1
shot sl01_main_leaving
wait 2
shot sl02_main_leaving_late
until 40 scene == "shell:Single Player"
assert shell_leaving == 0                               @R-143
wait 30
shot sl03_single_settled
click button "Main Menu"
wait 2
shot sl04_single_leaving_plates
until 40 scene == "shell:Main Menu"
set leave_band 0
click button "Single Player"
assert scene == "shell:Single Player"                   @R-143
assert shell_leaving == 0
end
